SCOPE

This licence covers everything in this repository, including
`twenty-nine-fine.mp3` — the track *Twenty-Nine Fine*.

The track was generated with Suno under a Pro subscription. Suno's own
documentation states that songs made while subscribed to the Pro or Premier
plan are owned by the subscriber, so the rights granted above are rights this
repository holds and can pass on.

One caveat, stated because it is true rather than because it changes the grant:
Suno notes that AI-generated material may not be eligible for copyright
protection at all, since copyright attaches to human authorship. If that turns
out to be so, the MIT grant over the track is belt and braces — you already had
the freedom it describes. The licence grants what there is to grant and makes no
claim that copyright subsists.
